  "title": "Peace & Quieter",
  "description": "A sound-focused resource pack that reduces loud, repetitive, and annoying Minecraft entity and ambient sounds.",
  "body": "Tired of Minecraft being too loud, repetitive, or distracting?\n\nThis resource pack reduces the volume of many entity, ambient, and environment sounds to create a calmer and more comfortable gameplay experience without completely removing the game's atmosphere.\n\nPerfect for:\n✅ Long survival sessions  \n✅ Content creators & streamers  \n✅ Relaxed gameplay  \n✅ Background gaming while listening to music or talking in VC  \n✅ Players sensitive to loud or repetitive sounds  \n\n## 🔊 Includes quieter sounds for:\n\n- Mobs & creatures\n- Villagers\n- Zombies\n- Wardens\n- Ghasts\n- Ender Dragon\n- Wither\n- Rain & thunder\n- Fire & water\n- Nether portals\n- Pistons\n- Minecarts\n- Chests\n- Explosions\n- Sculk sounds\n- And many more\n\n## ❌ Fully Removed Sounds\n\n- Cave sounds\n- Wither spawn sound\n- Dragon death sound\n\nThis pack is designed to keep Minecraft immersive while making the overall audio experience cleaner, softer, and less overwhelming.",
